backend/uploads/

# Private planning notes — contains the real, unredacted names behind the
# PARTIAL-tier projects (client/business names the public API is specifically
# built never to reveal). Must never be committed, even though this repo is
# public. Used locally only as the seed-data source for Flyway migrations.
plan/
*.log

# Claude Code local harness state (scheduled-task lock file, not project config)
.claude/

# Local staging copies of live-site screenshots used to seed the admin image
# uploader — the uploaded copies live in the DB-backed uploads volume
# (backend/uploads/, already gitignored above), which is the actual source
# of truth per the DB-backed-content architecture. These are just scratch.
docs/assets/screenshots/

# Session handoff material for manual transfer to the VPS (memory export,
# notes) — purely local, never uploaded anywhere, never committed.
ONBOARDING.md
.handoff/
